---
layout: base.njk
title: County profiles | CA Sea Change Atlas
description: Flood, sea level rise and ocean-economy exposure for California's coastal and Delta counties, with the year each figure covers and the reason behind every gap.
nav: county-profiles
extraScripts:
  - /js/county-picker.js
---
{%- set cp = countyProfiles %}
<div class="hero">
<svg class="contours" viewBox="0 0 1180 260" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M0 220 Q 150 180 300 220 T 600 220 T 900 220 T 1180 220" stroke="#F3EFE0" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
<path d="M0 240 Q 150 205 300 240 T 600 240 T 900 240 T 1180 240" stroke="#F3EFE0" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
<path d="M0 260 Q 150 230 300 260 T 600 260 T 900 260 T 1180 260" stroke="#F3EFE0" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
<path d="M0 200 Q 150 160 300 200 T 600 200 T 900 200 T 1180 200" stroke="#F3EFE0" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
</svg>
<div class="wrap">
<h1>County profiles</h1>
<p class="lede">What does sea level rise and flooding mean for my jurisdiction? Find your county and see its exposure, with the source and vintage of every figure.</p>
<p class="hero-about-link">Every figure is computed from public data and carries its source and vintage. The tool is still being built: <a href="{{ '/county-profiles/about/' | url }}">see how the figures are computed</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="main">
<div class="wrap cp">

<section class="cp-picker" aria-labelledby="cp-picker-title">
<h2 id="cp-picker-title">Choose a county</h2>
<div class="cp-picker-search" data-cp-search hidden>
<label for="cp-county-search">Search {{ cp.counties | length }} counties</label>
<input type="search" id="cp-county-search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Start typing a county name">
<p class="cp-picker-status" id="cp-picker-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</div>
<ul class="cp-county-list" id="cp-county-list">
{%- for c in cp.counties %}
<li data-county-name="{{ c.name | lower }}"><a href="{{ ('/county-profiles/county/' ~ c.slug ~ '/') | url }}">{{ c.name }}</a>{% if c.coverageNote %} <span class="cp-county-note">{{ c.coverageNote }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="cp-note">Counties with a note cover fewer topics. <a href="{{ '/county-profiles/about/data/' | url }}#coverage">Which topics each county covers</a>.</p>
</section>

</div>
</div>
